Email.description:
A validated email address.

This type ensures email addresses are validated at construction time.
Stored as TEXT in the database via SQLx's transparent encoding.

# Examples

```
use seren_core::models::Email;

let email = Email::new("user@example.com").unwrap();
assert!(Email::new("invalid").is_err());
```

best_sellers_rank.description:
Best Sellers position, 1 first, among templates that finished at least 10
tasks in the past 30 days, ordered by those tasks and the hourly rate;
null otherwise.

ManagedCodexAuth.description:
Codex authentication for a managed deployment. The credential is always a
reference to a Seren Secrets field that the deployment is already granted;
plaintext credentials are never accepted, stored, or returned.
